<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
the Quarterly Period Ended <span id="xdx_900_edei--DocumentPeriodEndDate_c20250101__20250930_zQ2Cui3penG9"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-09-30" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact000016" name="dei:DocumentPeriodEndDate">September 30, <span id="xdx_90D_edei--DocumentFiscalYearFocus_c20250101__20250930_zESBuIM4KGu2"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-09-30" id="Fact000017" name="dei:DocumentFiscalYearFocus">2025</ix:nonNumeric></span></ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

