Company expects to recognize <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250930_zAgo4Xq9e95j" title="Remaining performance obligations percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligationPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" id="Fact001044" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">100</ix:nonFraction></span>% of this revenue over the next 12 months.</span></p>

