    <td style="text-align: left">Expected dividends</td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: right"><span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput_iI_pid_uPure_c20250930__us-gaap--MeasurementInputTypeAxis__us-gaap--MeasurementInputExpectedDividendRateMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantsMember_zpxIcYG1O805" title="Warrants and rights outstanding, measurement input"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30_us-gaap_MeasurementInputExpectedDividendRateMember_custom_SeriesAWarrantsMember" id="Fact001569" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Pure">0</ix:nonFraction></span></td><td style="text-align: left">%</td></tr>
  </table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A5_z1Y3S20QHWOf" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the nine months ended September 30, 2025, in connection with the signing of the Exchange Agreements, see <span style="text-decoration: underline">Note 9 &#8211; PIPE Convertible
Notes</span>, PIPE Warrant holders exchanged their outstanding <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--IncrementalCommonSharesAttributableToCallOptionsAndWarrants_c20250101__20250930__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantsMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ExchangeAgreementsMember_zFMmPOByv306" title="Warrant exchange"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncrementalCommonSharesAttributableToCallOptionsAndWarrants" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-09-30_custom_SeriesAWarrantsMember_custom_ExchangeAgreementsMember" id="Fact001571" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">28,182</ix:nonFraction></span> Series A Warrants and <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--IncrementalCommonSharesAttributableToCallOptionsAndWarrants_c20250101__20250930__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesBWarrantsMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ExchangeAgreementsMember_zeI3vFHpdOfa" title="Warrant  exchanged"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncrementalCommonSharesAttributableToCallOptionsAndWarrants" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-09-30_custom_SeriesBWarrantsMember_custom_ExchangeAgreementsMember" id="Fact001573" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">31,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Series B Warrants for Series A Preferred
Warrants to purchase <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--IncrementalCommonSharesAttributableToCallOptionsAndWarrants_c20250101__20250930__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesAPreferredStockMember_znyQvB7iIaUf" title="Warrants purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncrementalCommonSharesAttributableToCallOptionsAndWarrants" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-09-30_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember" id="Fact001575" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">37,033</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Series A Preferred Stock. The Series A Preferred Warrants are immediately vested, have an exercise
price of $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20250930__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantsMember_zCvacphh1Nhe" title="Exercise price of warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30_custom_SeriesAWarrantsMember" id="Fact001577" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">900</ix:nonFraction></span>, and have a grant date fair value of $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants_c20250101__20250930__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantsMember_zWqHUy2pbRF4" title="Grant date fair value of warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-09-30_custom_SeriesAWarrantsMember" id="Fact001579" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">482,701</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


