<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-012025-09-30_custom_SeriesAWarrantsMember" escape="true" id="Fact001581" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfStockholdersEquityNoteWarrantsOrRightsTextBlock"><p id="xdx_894_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfStockholdersEquityNoteWarrantsOrRightsTextBlock_hus-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantsMember_zs6MzpUx6Gpg" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">A
summary of the Series A Warrant Activity during the nine months ended September 30, 2025, is presented below:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span><span id="xdx_8B2_zTuw420PIqC2" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF WARRANT ACTIVITY</span></p>

