</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AB_zlXDXpaWP8Ge" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Total
compensation expense related to options was $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20250701__20250930_z1dvW52JAsVa" title="Compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2025-07-012025-09-30" id="Fact001699" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">3,342</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20250101__20250930_zBdYIT2TRuo9" title="Compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-09-30" id="Fact001701" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">10,025</ix:nonFraction></span> for the three and nine months ended September 30, 2025. As of September
30, 2025, there was future compensation cost of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions_iI_c20250930_zAaxnmHEVrQ1" title="Future compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" id="Fact001703" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,114</ix:nonFraction></span> with a weighted average recognition period of <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerms_dtY_c20250101__20250930_zx7lSBOyMAgi" title="Weighted average remaining term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-09-30" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001705" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerms">0.25</ix:nonNumeric></span> years.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
aggregate intrinsic value totaled $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingIntrinsicValue_iI_dxL_c20250930_zYFEh2ZX1J" title="Intrinsic value::XDX::-"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1707">0</span></span> and was based on the Company&#8217;s closing stock price of $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockPricePerShare_iI_c20250930_z9vkRMe3Vp0h" title="Stock price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" id="Fact001709" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">2.42</ix:nonFraction></span> as of September 30, 2025, which
would have been received by the option holders had all option holders exercised their options as of that date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Stock-Based
Compensation Expense</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

