<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Fair
value measurements discussed herein are based upon certain market assumptions and pertinent information available to management as of
and during the nine months ended September 30, 2025. The carrying amounts of cash equivalents, accounts receivable, other current assets,
other assets, accounts payable, and accrued expenses approximated their fair values as of the nine months ended September 30, 2025, due
to their short-term nature.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

