    <td style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the ability to recognize
    the anticipated benefits of our business and the Business Combination, which may be affected by, among other things, competition
